  "created": "2026-10-08T03:33:37.023Z",
  "description": "Static analyzer that flags the classic .NET \"sync over async\" footgun: a direct '.Result' property access, '.Wait()'/'.Wait(timeout)' method call, or a '.GetAwaiter().GetResult()' chain, on an expression whose static type is Task/Task<T> -- instead of 'await'ing it. Blocking on async code this way can deadlock under a captured SynchronizationContext (classic ASP.NET, WPF/WinForms) and causes thread-pool starvation under load even where it doesn't deadlock (ASP.NET Core).",
  "id": "Taskblockslip",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-08T03:37:51.64Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
